modulate = Color(0, 1, 0, 1)
text = "Some time ago, in what seems like a galaxy far, far away....
Dark times have fallen upon the household.

Your partner has left you. The dishes remain unwashed, the floors are buried beneath layers of dust, and chaos has spread to every corner of your once-peaceful home.

From the shadows beneath the furniture, an ancient evil has risen.

THE DUST BUNNIES.

Once harmless creatures of forgotten corners, they have grown in numbers, gathering strength and plotting to take over the entire house.

With no one left to stand against them, the household faces certain doom.

But all hope is not lost.

Armed with nothing but a vacuum cleaner and a questionable amount of determination, an unlikely hero must rise to face the growing darkness."
